    "body": "OK. There were some without hyphens. I will update them too.\r\n\r\n> Can it be insn:amocasq[]-level to be robust to future formatting changes?\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, while there is in fact `insn:amocas.q[]`, AMOCASQ-level should look like AMOArithmetic-level, so `insn:amocasq[]-level` seems an abuse of macros.\r\n\r\nAMOSwap-level would be another example. It is directly related to `insn:amoswap[]` but not styled as `AMOSWAP`-level.",
